  "notes": [
    "Reuse existing named is_archive stub at45cd40; do not duplicate it.",
    "ReadInputArgument has three stack inputs/three RET12 paths; no hidden register input.",
    "Only actual first callee is_archive is expected, subject to next real fresh capture.",
    "Mac resource classifier validates classic resource-fork256-byte layout; its complete body and reachable calls remain pending.",
    "Source field+0c is an opaque argument tag copied to library+34/object+34; original higher-level meaning unproved.",
    "Existing FileRecord.file_size at+1c is the mapped cursor, not the total file size; do not allocate duplicate storage.",
    "is_archive compares exactly8 bytes of literal !<arch>\\n at402e68; NUL is not read by that comparison. Future ownership must be exact, with fresh changed-mask execution.",
    "is_archive current8B read advances only the mapped cursor on success; next natural mapped-read boundary must retain output local8B own pre-bytes and complete input2262B backing/view."
